{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07616","headline":"登水门楼见亡友张贞期题望黄河诗因以感兴 · 崔曙","name":"登水门楼见亡友张贞期题望黄河诗因以感兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾友东南美，昔闻登此楼。\n人随川上逝，书向壁中留。\n严子好真隐，谢公耽远游。\n清风初作颂，暇日复销忧。\n时与文字古，迹将山水幽。\n已孤苍生望，空见黄河流。\n流落年将晚，悲凉物已秋。\n天高不可问，掩泣赴行舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07616.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07616","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}